error BYN3004: `buf` is modified while `t` still borrows it

  8 │     buf.clear()
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^ `t` is used again on line 9
    │
  help: finish using `t` first, or copy what it needs before changing `buf`

error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it

  14 │         kept = get(() => name)
     │                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
